The Fluted Glass effect in this folder is a TSL port of the Fluted Glass
shader from @paper-design/shaders (v0.0.82), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see /licenses/Apache-2.0.txt). It was changed: ported
from GLSL to three.js TSL, margins and grain removed, blur limited to a few
taps, and parameters mapped onto DMT's GlyphStyle.paper.flutedGlass.

The Aberration effect is not in that package version; it is an original
implementation of the same idea (RGB channel offset along a radial direction).
